%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS digital-output)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(BTER TOOL SETTER - CONTACT CHECK; legacy filename retained for compatibility.)
(No axis or spindle command. The passive NC circuits use fixed commons.)
(No clip, OUT5 switching, tool-length calculation or offset changes.)
o<ts_contact_preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<ts_contact_preview> endif
#<contact_timeout_seconds> = 300.0
o<dmc2_tool_setter_ready> call
(MSG,Tool setter contact check: press the setter pad, then release it. Abort and Pendant Mode remain available.)
M66 P0 L1 Q#<contact_timeout_seconds>
o<ts_contact_timeout> if [#5399 LT 0]
    (ABORT,No setter contact arrived within the contact-check timeout. Use Abort then Pendant Mode; check the TOOL SETTER CONTACT indication before a new Run.)
o<ts_contact_timeout> endif
(DEBUG,Tool setter IN0 contact was reported. Waiting for the pad to be released.)
M66 P0 L4 Q#<contact_timeout_seconds>
o<ts_release_timeout> if [#5399 LT 0]
    (ABORT,The setter contact remains open. Release the pad or correct the contact circuit, then use Clear Fault and Pendant Mode before a new Run.)
o<ts_release_timeout> endif
o<dmc2_tool_setter_ready> call
(DEBUG,Tool setter check recorded an IN0 contact and release; the overtravel circuit is closed.)
M2
%
